    "description": "Rex: a real terminal in Pi Pocket, beside a session or as a page of its own. Ghostty's own engine (libghostty-vt) draws the screen, so an editor's cursor shapes, its icons, and its clipboard work. It needs Bun, and a runtime folder of its own, ~/.pi-pocket/rex.",
